# Design sandboxes — local references, never shipped.
# They live under public/ so `next dev` still serves them at /sandboxes/<name>.html,
# which is what makes them usable; being ignored is what keeps them off the
# deployed archive, where they were previously reachable by anyone who guessed
# the filename. Keep them, do not commit them. See public/sandboxes/README.md.
public/sandboxes/
.qa/
.backups/
